tools/node_modules

# Throwaway diagnostics. Critics and debugging sessions write one-off
# scripts in tools/; the keepers are named for what they do (harness,
# playtest, audit, perf, still, statediff, audio-lab, play-l*).
# Extension-agnostic on purpose: reviewers write these in whatever language
# suits the measurement — a PNG luminance sampler is easier in Python than
# in node — and a .py throwaway is no more a deliverable than a .mjs one.
tools/diag*
tools/dbg*
tools/crit*
tools/tmp*
tools/zoom*
tools/refdump.mjs
tools/play-l1b.mjs
tools/bell.mjs
tools/crop.mjs
lum.py
__pycache__/
dist/
